<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  ============================================================================
  RUT_WickStem.xml                       UtinniPatches · SUMP_MECHANICS_1 (S5)
  ============================================================================
  sump_kit_spec.md S5: "Harvest: RUT_WickStem  — torch/lamp fuel via
  CompRefuelable fuel filters and a tradeable candle good (items pass owns
  pricing)." The harvest of RUT_Plant_Wick (ThingDefs_Plants/, same pass).

  Plain resource good, no comps of its own: CompRefuelable lives on the
  FUEL-CONSUMING building (a lamp/torch), which lists this def in its own
  fuelFilter — nothing about the fuel ITEM needs a comp for that to work,
  confirmed against Chemfuel's own def (Core/Defs/ThingDefs_Items/
  Items_Resource_Manufactured.xml) which carries CompProperties_Explosive
  for an unrelated reason (volatility), not for fuel-filter eligibility
  itself. No refuelable building references this def yet — that's the
  derrick-lamp/torch building's own content-pass work (§7b stations, items
  pass), not built this pass.

  MarketValue 1.5 is an explicit INVENTED PLACEHOLDER, not a real pricing
  call — the kit spec is explicit that "items pass owns pricing." Left
  un-zero only so the def has a legal, tradeable value rather than
  defaulting to 0 and reading as worthless; expect this number to be
  replaced, not treated as load-bearing.

  Not flammable enough to ignore, not so flammable it's a walking bomb:
  Flammability 1.5, between Wood's 1.0 and Chemfuel's 2.0  — candle/lamp
  stock, not raw volatile fuel. No CompRottable: matches WoodLog's own
  precedent (dried plant fuel-stock, not perishable food) rather than
  RawBerries' (a food good that rots).

  Texture reused from vanilla (Things/Item/Resource/WoodLog, a real,
  confirmed texPath, Core/Defs/ThingDefs_Items/Items_Resource_Stuff.xml:254)
  as a stick/stem placeholder  — art pass owed, same practice as this pass's
  RUT_Plant_Wick.xml.
  ============================================================================
-->
<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
    <defName>RUT_WickStem</defName>
    <label>wick-stem</label>
    <description>A dried, waxy stem from a wick-plant, split and cured for burning. Slow and steady — it is the closest thing to a candle the Sump ever grows, and every station lamp-garden exists to keep a supply of it.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Item/Resource/WoodLog</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_StackCount</graphicClass>
    </graphicData>
    <statBases>
      <MarketValue>1.5</MarketValue>
      <MaxHitPoints>50</MaxHitPoints>
      <Mass>0.15</Mass>
      <Flammability>1.5</Flammability>
      <DeteriorationRate>0.5</DeteriorationRate>
    </statBases>
    <thingCategories>
      <li>ResourcesRaw</li>
    </thingCategories>
  </ThingDef>

</Defs>
